   "start": 1187,
   "end": 1519,
   "bones": [],
   "labels": [],
   "text": "The pterion: where frontal, parietal, temporal, and sphenoid meet. It is the thinnest part of the skull, and the middle meningeal artery runs beneath it. A fracture here can tear the artery and cause an epidural hematoma.",
