   "start": 2686,
   "end": 3086,
   "bones": [
    1,
    2,
    3
   ],
   "labels": [],
   "text": "Three holes in a row across the sphenoid. The foramen rotundum carries the maxillary nerve, the second division of the trigeminal. Behind it, the foramen ovale carries the mandibular nerve, the third division, and the foramen spinosum carries the middle meningeal artery.",
